<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank, Bayer Hypo, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Sal-Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON    *4.125     MATURITY    23.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE  S-23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    DUSS	REOFFER     99.95</p>
<p> NOTES     *4.125 PCT TO 23.JAN.98 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		STEPS-UP TO 4.70 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  1.95	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
